; nexus_theme.tres
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Project Nexus - Global UI Theme (P1.1, v0.6.0).
;
; A single, dark, "military strategy" flat theme applied project-wide via
; project.godot -> gui/theme/custom. It gives every Button / Panel / Label a
; consistent rounded, high-contrast look so the game stops looking like raw
; engine defaults. Purely cosmetic -- never referenced by the simulation.
;
; Palette:
;   bg      #12161d   panel background (near-black blue)
;   panel   #1b212c   raised panels
;   accent  #3d6fb4   interactive blue (buttons)
;   accent+ #4d84d4   hover
;   accent- #2c5290   pressed
;   text    #e0e8f2   primary text
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

