[resource]
; P1.1 (v0.6.0): a bundled Vazirmatn face gives the whole UI a clean, readable
; look with full Persian + Latin coverage, replacing the engine's fallback font.
; Purely cosmetic -- never referenced by the simulation / deterministic hash.
